== Trivia ==
* Defeating {{e|Delirium}} as most tainted characters will unlock their gameplay characteristic. Interestingly, Tainted Lost's passive ability to reroll low quality items ({{I|Sacred Orb}}) is unlocked through defeating {{E|The Beast}} instead.
* This item may be a reference to "Super Ghost Kamikaze Attack" from ''Dragon Ball Z''.

